The TSL particle study follows the storage-buffer / compute / sprite rendering
pattern in the three.js r180 attractor example:
https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/r180/examples/webgpu_tsl_compute_attractors_particles.html
The force field, artwork, fixed seeds, controls and integration here are modified.

